    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5]\ntheorem erdos_23 : answer(sorry) ↔\n    ∀ (n : ℕ) (V : Type) [Fintype V], Fintype.card V = 5 * n →\n      ∀ (G : SimpleGraph V), G.CliqueFree 3 →\n        ∃ (H : SimpleGraph V),\n          H ≤ G ∧ H.IsBipartite ∧ (G.edgeFinset \\ H.edgeFinset).card ≤ n^2",
